.env
__pycache__/

# selftest_game_wiki.py's output: the same pages a real run writes, but with
# stub prose where the model's would be. Regenerated in seconds and useful only
# while looking at a change, unlike results/wiki, which is a real proof run.
results/selftest-wiki/

# generate_game_wiki.py's output. Not committed, for two reasons: it cites paths
# inside game-ontology's gitignored out/, so the citations only resolve on the
# machine that ran the exploration; and it is regenerated whole from a map plus
# a model, so a committed copy would rot silently against both. Re-run the
# generator to get it back.
results/game-wiki/
